AUDIO: 'I\'ve grown from zero to three million followers solo. I built my first AI company at age 30, sold it for over $10 million. And today, I\'m going to show you how I would build a profitable oneperson business and personal brand in 30 days with AI. Starting with choosing your topic. So, days 1 through three,'

[00:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you want to choose a topic you actually enjoy. In marketing, people call this a niche. It\'s basically the same thing. So examples of topics might be AI, could be cooking, it could be fitness, could be'

[00:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'dieting, could be relationship, etc. Think about broad topics first. Okay? And then what you want to think about is three overlapping areas. Number one is what you actually enjoy. I know a lot of'

[00:38] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'people trying to get into AI who number one don\'t enjoy learning technology. Number two get really flustered and frustrated with AI. If you\'re just pursuing it because you see it\'s a gold rush. Like you absolutely can be'

